					<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/nameless-mediocre" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(4176498); return false;"  ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4176498&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608238071" alt="Nameless Mediocre" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4176498)"/></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/nameless-mediocre" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(4176498); return false;" >Nameless Mediocre</a></span> <span class="odate time_1583445576 format_%25e%20%25b%20%25Y%2C%20%25H%3A%25M%7Cagohover">05 Mar 2020 21:59</span>
