			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-4533348">
									

<p>This article strikes me as something made from the human subconscious trying to rationalize something it can't and has lost or isolated inside itself. I'm not sure <em>why</em> it is rationalizing it as a pineapple but that is hardly an issue. The human brain makes some weird connections when it doesn't have an exact definition or concrete concept to attach something it is perceiving to.</p>
